Rakuten DevOps Interview – L1 Round | Key Questions
I recently attended a DevOps L1 interview with Rakuten and wanted to share some of the key topics discussed. 
🔹 CI/CD & Jenkins
End-to-end pipeline design
Jenkinsfile implementation
Artifact management and deployment flow
🔹 Docker
Dockerfile best practices
Layer caching vs image optimization
Versioned images vs latest tag
🔹 Kubernetes
Deployment vs StatefulSet
Horizontal Pod Autoscaler (HPA)
NetworkPolicy (Ingress/Egress)
Secrets management
🔹 Helm
Handling multiple values.yaml files
Precedence of values.yaml, -f, and --set
🔹 AWS & Networking
Public vs Private Subnet
NAT Gateway and its working
Communication between instances across VPCs
Ephemeral ports
🔹 Scenario-Based Questions
Debugging deployment failures
Root Cause Analysis (RCA)
Handling production issues
💡 Key Takeaway:
The interview focused heavily on practical knowledge, real-time scenarios, and clarity of understanding rather than just theoretical concepts.
